### Get Hello by Name
GET http://localhost:8080/api/hello/Kotlin

###

### Post Hello
POST http://localhost:8080/api/hello
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Ricky",
    "age": 30,
    "email": "ricky@example.com"
}

