### Post Math addition
POST http://localhost:8080/api/math/add
Content-Type: application/json  

{
  "a": 5,
  "b": 3
}

### ── Chatbot API ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Chat
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Explain the difference between a class and an object in Kotlin.",
  "history": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Keep it concise."
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I will keep it brief."
    }
  ]
}

###

### Chat with search fallback
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "search current Kotlin 2.0 release highlights"
}

### Send Message API
POST http://localhost:8080/api/send-message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Explain Kotlin coroutines in simple terms.",
  "history": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Keep it short."
    }
  ]
}

### ── Multimodal APIs ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Vision Status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/vision/status

###

### Analyze Image
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vision?prompt=Describe%20this%20image.
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="own_logo.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< src/main/resources/static/own_logo.png
--boundary--

###

### Image Status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/image/status

###

### Generate Image
POST http://localhost:8080/api/image
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "A cinematic workspace with Kotlin code on a floating holographic screen"
}

