### Update User
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ricky Updated",
  "age": 31,
  "email": "ricky.updated@example.com"
}

###

### Delete User
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/users/1

